IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-DISTILL-V5.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SUBNETS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TEACHER-PARAMS-M    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 STUDENT-PARAMS-M    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DISTILL-V5.
    IF NUM-SUBNETS == 0 OR TEACHER-PARAMS-M == 0 OR STUDENT-PARAMS-M == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 26800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-SUBNETS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
